# Amonkhet Raceway: "Start your engines!", "{T}: Add {C}" and "Max speed — {T}: Target creature gains haste until end of
# turn" (CR 702.178a: as long as your speed is 4, the land has that ability). Playing it on turn 1 gives Bot1 speed 1
# (CR 702.179a); a Lightning Bolt on each of turns 1, 3 and 5 raises it once on each of those turns (CR 702.179d): 2, 3,
# then 4. At speed 3 the haste ability is not offered though the land is untapped, and its mana ability is. At speed 4
# it is, and gives a Memnite cast that turn haste, so that the Memnite attacks: Bot2 ends at 20 - 9 - 1 = 10.

